<title>USA: IPO FILING - Innova Corp.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - Innova Corp.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		    Innova Corp</p>
<p>Stock symbol			INVA.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $10-$12/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    2.5 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 2.5 million</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    12,124,012</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter		 UBS Securities</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  375,000 shrs Business: Based in Seattle, Wash., Innova designs, manufactures and supports millimeter wave radios for use as short-to-medium-distance wireless communication links in telecommunications networks in both developed and developing markets.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: Repayment of debt, equipment purchases, working capital and general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>Financial Data in 000s year ended March 31:</p>
<p>				   1996		 1995</p>
<p>   - Revenue		  $1,962	     $2,358</p>
<p>   - Net Income (loss)   ($9,061)	   ($6,318)</p>
